# Bacillus anthracis MLVA-8 of Keim et al. 2000, in the published marker order: the six
# chromosomal loci vrrA, vrrB1, vrrB2, vrrC1, vrrC2 and CG3, then the two plasmid loci
# pXO1-aat and pXO2-at. Fluorescent label prefixes in the source primer table are not part
# of the oligonucleotides and are not included here; scheme.yml records which primer carries
# which dye. The expected size is a search window around the reference product wide enough
# for the published allele ranges, not the product itself; markers.tsv holds the reference
# size. It only bounds the search and does not affect allele calls.
vrrA	CACAACTACCACCGATGGCACA	GCGCGTTTCGTTTGATTCATAC	250-450
vrrB1	ATAGGTGGTTTTCCGCAAGTTATTC	GATGAGTTTGATAAAGAATAGCCTGTG	180-350
vrrB2	CACAGGCTATTCTTTATCAAACTCATC	CCCAAGGTGAAGATTGTTGTTGA	100-280
vrrC1	GAAGCAAGAAAGTGATGTAGTGGAC	CATTTCCTCAAGTGCTACAGGTTC	450-800
vrrC2	CCAGAAGAAGTGGAACCTGTAGCAC	GTCTTTCCATTAATCGCGCTCTATC	450-700
CG3	TGTCGTTTTACTTCTCTCTCCAATAC	AGTCATTGTTCTGTATAAAGGGCAT	110-250
pXO1-aat	CAATTTATTAACGATCAGATTAAGTTCA	TCTAGAATTAGTTGCTTCATAATGGC	90-220
pXO2-at	TCATCCTCTTTTAAGTCTTGGGT	GTGTGATGAACTCCGACGACA	100-220
